{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And you shall set some of it before the testimony in the tent of meeting.</b> It is possible to interpret that Scripture mentions here the entire preparation of the incense — it says that from it he shall burn incense before the testimony in the Holy of Holies, and that is the incense of Yom Kippur, and he shall burn incense from it in the tent of meeting every day — and \"where I will meet with you there\" would refer back to the testimony. And it is also possible that it mentions that he shall set some of it on the inner altar, which is placed before the Ark of the Testimony, for so it says in the portion of VaYakhel (see Exodus 40 below)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:19:08.189253839Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}